cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "bar-quenching-desi-sdss: a controlled comparison of bar strength and quenching"
abstract: >-
  Analysis pipeline, derived catalogue, figures and per-cell result tables for a
  comparison of bar class and star-formation quenching within bins of
  stellar mass, bulge prominence and redshift,
  using Galaxy Zoo DESI deep-learning morphology cross-matched to SDSS MPA-JHU
  spectroscopy.
